<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech o/n sell and buy tender yields 16.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech o/n sell and buy tender yields 16.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield in a Czech Finance Ministry overnight sell and buy tender reached the limit of 16.2 percent, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The limit rate was lowered on Thursday from a previous 18.2 percent.</p>
<p>The CNB did not reveal the volume of accepted bids.</p>
<p>The Prague Interbank Offered Rate (PRIBOR) for overnight funds ranged around 18.00 percent on Thursday morning.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
